WEBVTT

00:06:58.292 --> 00:07:01.309
You are more readily available

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:05.143
to failing first,

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:06.833
and failing first --

00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:09.809
(Laughter)

00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:15.393
far outweighs the lengths we go to

00:07:15.417 --> 00:07:17.809
to appeal to others,

00:07:17.833 --> 00:07:20.059
to our partners and to ourselves.

00:07:20.083 --> 00:07:23.059
We spend billions and billions of dollars

00:07:23.083 --> 00:07:26.351
on clothing, on makeup,

00:07:26.375 --> 00:07:28.750
on the latest trend of glasses,